# The legal documents are deployment configuration, not source. They name a
# specific operator and data controller, so shipping ours would have every
# installation republishing our claims as its own. Write your own and drop them
# here — see docs/deployment/public-site.md.
/public/locales/legal/

# Research data never belongs in the repository. Interview records and species
# lists are the researcher's, not ours, and an accidental `git add -A` is the
# way they would end up published.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
